From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:20:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Keep fixed-center DuoView selected across native frame
 failures

---
 src/mods/VR.cpp                          |  2 --
 src/mods/VR.hpp                          | 38 +++++++++++++++-------
 src/mods/vr/D3D12Component.cpp           | 40 +++++++++++++++++-------
 src/mods/vr/FFakeStereoRenderingHook.cpp |  8 ++---
 4 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/mods/VR.cpp b/src/mods/VR.cpp
index 6edf3b13..1e6627dd 100644
--- a/src/mods/VR.cpp
+++ b/src/mods/VR.cpp
@@ -15462,8 +15462,6 @@ void VR::on_draw_sidebar_entry(std::string_view name) {
                     draw_status_badge("DuoView status:", "unsupported: D3D12 required", blocked_color);
